  "section_breaks": [],
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在提出的问题是：把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在提出的问题是：把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用分式的基本性质，我们可以把这个问题归结为前一小节所研究的同分母分式的加法问题．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "应用分式的基本性质，我们可以把这个问题归结为前一小节所研究的同分母分式的加法问题．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为此，把前一个分式的分子与分母同乘以 $d$，而把后一个分式的分子与分母同乘以 $b$，得到：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "为此，把前一个分式的分子与分母同乘以 $d$，而把后一个分式的分子与分母同乘以 $b$，得到：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式 $d$ 叫做分式 $\\frac ab$ 的分子与分母的附加因式，式 $b$ 是分式$\\frac cd$ 的分子与分母的附加因式．我们已经把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 变形成同分母的分式 $\\frac{ad}{bd}$ 与 $\\frac{bc}{bd}$．这时就说，分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 已经通分．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#8",
        "p0016#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "式 $d$ 叫做分式 $\\frac ab$ 的分子与分母的附加因式，式 $b$ 是分式$\\frac cd$ 的分子与分母的附加因式．我们已经把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 变形成同分母的分式 $\\frac{ad}{bd}$ 与 $\\frac{bc}{bd}$．这时就说，分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 已经通分．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在可以把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在可以把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分式：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "对于使其左右两边有意义的所有变量值，等式 $\\frac ab+\\frac cd$ $=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$ 是真等式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 10,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0016#12",
        "p0017#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "对于使其左右两边有意义的所有变量值，等式 $\\frac ab+\\frac cd$ $=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$ 是真等式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在把几个分式的和变形成一个分式的过程中，常常能够找到比各项分母的积更简单的公分母．我们看两个例子．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "在把几个分式的和变形成一个分式的过程中，常常能够找到比各项分母的积更简单的公分母．我们看两个例子．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1．把式 $\\frac{b^2}{a^5}+\\frac4{a^3}$ 变形成一个分式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "1．把式 $\\frac{b^2}{a^5}+\\frac4{a^3}$ 变形成一个分式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这两个分式的分母是变量 $a$ 的幂．显然，它们的公分母可以是单项式 $a^5$，因为 $a^5=a^3\\cdot a^2$．两个分式的分子与分母的附加因式分别等于 $1$ 与 $a^2$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "这两个分式的分母是变量 $a$ 的幂．显然，它们的公分母可以是单项式 $a^5$，因为 $a^5=a^3\\cdot a^2$．两个分式的分子与分母的附加因式分别等于 $1$ 与 $a^2$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们有：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "我们有：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{b^2}{a^5}+\\frac4{a^3}=\\frac{b^2\\cdot1}{a^5\\cdot1}+\\frac{4\\cdot a^2}{a^3\\cdot a^2}=\\frac{b^2+4a^2}{a^5}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac{b^2}{a^5}+\\frac4{a^3}=\\frac{b^2\\cdot1}{a^5\\cdot1}+\\frac{4\\cdot a^2}{a^3\\cdot a^2}=\\frac{b^2+4a^2}{a^5}$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2．把差 $\\frac{a+3}{a^2+ab}-\\frac{b-3}{ab+b^2}$ 变形成一个分式．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "2．把差 $\\frac{a+3}{a^2+ab}-\\frac{b-3}{ab+b^2}$ 变形成一个分式．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了找出最简公分母，我们把各分式的分母分解因式．有：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "为了找出最简公分母，我们把各分式的分母分解因式．有：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{a+3}{a^2+ab}-\\frac{b-3}{ab+b^2}=\\frac{a+3}{a(a+b)}-\\frac{b-3}{b(a+b)} =\\frac{(a+3)b-(b-3)a}{ab(a+b)}=\\frac{ab+3b-ab+3a}{ab(a+b)}=\\frac{3(a+b)}{ab(a+b)} =\\frac3{ab}$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 11,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0017#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\frac{a+3}{a^2+ab}-\\frac{b-3}{ab+b^2}=\\frac{a+3}{a(a+b)}-\\frac{b-3}{b(a+b)}  =\\frac{(a+3)b-(b-3)a}{ab(a+b)}=\\frac{ab+3b-ab+3a}{ab(a+b)}=\\frac{3(a+b)}{ab(a+b)}  =\\frac3{ab}$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
